## Title: AKForeverCombatTimers
## Notes: Combat timers for WoW: Forever in one block - the target's cast and the next enemy hit grow up from a seam, your main hand, off hand, ranged swings, buff timer, your damage-over-time spells on what you are fighting, the windows for Overpower / Revenge / Mongoose Bite / Counterattack / Riposte, the Plainsrunning ramp and your own cast grow down from it. Every bar: always / when used / never, size, order.
